<g-shell id="page-shell" title="认领这道拿手菜" back="{{true}}"><scroll-view class="scroll" scroll-y><view class="page-content"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-tip" bindtap="retry">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{reminder}}" class="cooking-letter"><view class="letter-eyebrow">小家寄来一封确认信</view><view class="h2">这道菜，是你做的吗？</view><text class="caption">{{reminder.date}} · {{reminder.slot}}</text><image src="{{reminder.cover}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="h3 strong">{{reminder.name}}</view><view wx:if="{{reminder.cooker}}" class="claim-resolved"><g-icon name="check" size="23"/><text>{{reminder.cooker.identity}}已确认做完</text></view><text wx:else class="claim-help">只确认自己实际做的菜。第一位确认的人记为做菜人，其他提醒随即失效。</text><button hover-class="none" wx:if="{{reminder.claimable}}" class="btn" bindtap="claim" loading="{{actionBusy}}">是我做的，确认认领</button><button hover-class="none" class="btn secondary" bindtap="notMine">{{reminder.claimable?'不是我，暂不认领':'返回小家消息'}}</button></view></view></scroll-view></g-shell>